ial: ttyS1 at MMIO 0x10201000 (irq = 164, base_baud = 15625000) is a Synopsys DesignWare\",\"title\":\"1206724: Required Config for Exploitation\"}],\"product_status\":{\"first_affected\":[\"CSAFPID-0\"],\"fixed\":[\"CSAFPID-2\"]},\"references\":[{\"category\":\"external\",\"summary\":\"MITRE\",\"url\":\"https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2025-8870\"}],\"remediations\":[{\"category\":\"vendor_fix\",\"details\":\"Fixed in EOS version 4.35.0\",\"product_ids\":[\"CSAFPID-2\"]},{\"category\":\"none_available\",\"details\":\"Not fixed in EOS version 4.34.2FX-710XP\",\"product_ids\":[\"CSAFPID-1\"]},{\"category\":\"none_available\",\"details\":\"Not fixed in EOS version 4.34.2FX-710XP.1\",\"product_ids\":[\"CSAFPID-0\"]},{\"category\":\"mitigation\",\"details\":\"The mitigation is to limit access to the serial console.\"}],\"scores\":[{\"cvss_v3\":{\"baseScore\":4.9,\"baseSeverity\":\"MEDIUM\",\"vectorString\":\"CVSS:3.1/AV:P/AC:H/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:N/I:N/A:H\",\"version\":\"3.1\"},\"products\":[\"CSAFPID-5\",\"CSAFPID-2\",\"CSAFPID-6\",\"CSAFPID-4\",\"CSAFPID-0\",\"CSAFPID-3\",\"CSAFPID-1\"]}],\"title\":\"CVE-2025-8870\"}]}},{\"num\":\"122\",\"data\":{\"document\":{\"category\":\"security_advisory\",\"csaf_version\":\"2.0\",\"distribution\":{\"tlp\":{\"label\":\"WHITE\",\"url\":\"https://www.first.org/tlp/\"}},\"lang\":\"en-US\",\"publisher\":{\"category\":\"vendor\",\"contact_details\":\"support@arista.com\",\"name\":\"Arista PSIRT\",\"namespace\":\"https://www.arista.com\"},\"references\":[{\"category\":\"self\",\"summary\":\"Security advisory 122 canonical URL\",\"url\":\"https://www.arista.com/en/support/advisories-notices/security-advisory/22022-security-advisory-0122\"}],\"title\":\"Security Advisory 122\",\"tracking\":{\"current_release_date\":\"2025-09-30T18:44:54Z\",\"generator\":{\"engine\":{\"name\":\"Arista Networks SecEng Service CSAF Generator\"}},\"id\":\"Arista Networks Security Advisory 122\",\"initial_release_date\":\"2025-09-30T18:44:54Z\"